==Trivia==
*Gigahaniwan is the only [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] whose English description says "ancient lab" rather than "secret lab". This is closer to Ancient Laboratory, a literal translation of the Japanese name of [[Laboratory of Relics]], which is mentioned directly in most Colossus enemies' Japanese descriptions.
*Gigahaniwan is the only Colossus [[Gauntlet]] boss whose English description does not say its lethality increases with each battle, likely as a result of the in-game character limit being more restrictive for the English version due to the differences between the Japanese and English languages.
*Gigahaniwan is the first enemy to be immune to Curse.

